1. **Experiment and Systems:** STAR Experiment at RHIC ($\sqrt{s_{\text{NN}}} = 200\text{ GeV}$) covering $p+p$, $d+\text{Au}$, and $\text{Au}+\text{Au}$.
2. **Kinematic Selections:** $3 < p_T^{\text{trig}} < 4\text{ GeV}/c$ and $1 < p_T^{\text{assoc}} < 2\text{ GeV}/c$.
3. **Methodology & Systematics:** Explicit mention of background subtraction methods focusing on anisotropic flow harmonics ($v_2$ and $v_4$).
4. **Physics Discrimination:** Direct comparison between **conical flow (Mach cones)** and **QCD-Cerenkov radiation** models via away-side angular modifications.
